

   Trion support net
   ================


   To make it more easy to keep contact with Trion BBS sysops
   and give support to the sysops and spread new versions a
   network with the name Trion-Net was setup.

   First it was just a little net between the Beta testers with
   the author (Paul Spijkerman) as headquarters .. but when
   more nodes joint .. the decision was made that one of the
   Beta testers Frank Smit would become the head quarters.
   But after some years Frank stopped his BBS and Pascal
   Dreissen took over.
   (Note: Pascal also started a newsgroup for Trion-BBS called:
    ALT.BBS.AMIGA.TRION)

   The net consists of a some echomail and file (tick) areas,
   these areas are already configured in this package.

   To join Trion-net contact one of the Hosts or the HeadQuarters
   Pascal Dreissen (Pascal@ddimedia.com).

   You'll find the current nodelist in the trion:nodelists/
   directory .. look for the file 'tronlist.xxx'.

   When this text is written there are only hosts and nodes
   in Holland .. if you live outside Holland it's more
   difficult to get a link to the net .. but you can always
   contact the HeadQuarters .. maybe there is a new host or
   maybe you want to be a host.

   (Note: If there are no local hosts or hubs there are some
    possebilities to get Trion-net to you through E-mail)



  Trion net echomail area's.
  --------------------------

  Echomail area :      TRION_CHAT

  Acces   :            All

  Usage   :            Chat area.


  Echomail area :      TRION_CHAT_NL

  Acces   :            All

  Usage   :            Chat area. (Dutch)


  Echomail area :      TRION_NEWS

  Acces   :            All    (only for real news .. not a chat area !!)

  Usage   :            For news on versions, utils, doors, the net, etc..



  Echomail area :      TRION_QUEST

  Acces   :            All

  Usage   :            For questions about the BBS and utils.
                       Note that anybody with a good answer may reply !!!



  Echomail area :      TRION_REQUEST

  Acces   :            All

  Usage   :            For requests of features for integration in the
                       Trion BBS package.


  Echomail area :      TRION_PROBLEMS

  Acces   :            All

  Usage   :            For discussion of noted problems.



  Echomail area :      TRION_TEST

  Acces   :            All

  Usage   :            For testing mail.




  Trion net file area's from 15 februari 1996.
  --------------------------------------------


  File net area :   TRION_UPDATES

  Acces   :         Registered trion users  (receive only)

  Usage   :         For updates to new versions or bugfixes.



  File net area :   TRION_BBS

  Acces   :         All (receive only)

  Usage   :         For complete new versions of the Trion BBS packet.



  File net area :   TRION_MISC

  Acces   :         All

  Usage   :    For all things not mentioned with the other file areas but
               that can be usefull with the Trion BBS .. things like:
               Cron, Xprlibs, doors, archivers, etc...



  File net area :   TRION_NLST

  Acces   :         All (receive only)

  Usage   :         For the nodelists of Trion net.



